--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Unique
         ->  Gather Merge
               Workers Planned: 2
               ->  ProjectSet
                     ->  Parallel Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiDistinctQueryScan)
                           ->  Parallel Index Only Scan using idxpar_a_c_b on documents_39908 collection
                                 Index Cond: ((document @> '{ "b" : { "$numberInt" : "5" } }'::bson) AND (document @<> '{ "a" : { "orderByScan" : { "$numberInt" : "1" } } }'::bson))
                                 Order By: (document |-<> '{ "a" : { "$numberInt" : "1" } }'::bson)
(9 rows)

